# Authentication Option 1 (For Restricted / Private Sheets - Recommended):
# Paste the Google Service Account JSON string or file path:
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY={"type":"service_account",...}
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./service-account.json

# Authentication Option 2 (For Public Sheets with Link Access):
